message: "If you use CSTL in academic research or commercial deployment, please cite this work."
title: "CSTL: A Compressed Semantic Transfer Language for Lossless LLM-to-LLM Communication"
authors:
  - family-names: "Goyette"
    given-names: "Olivier"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
